---
code: field.name.upper-kebab-case
description: Convert field names to SCREAMING-KEBAB-CASE (URLValue -> URL-VALUE)
default-enabled: false
---

# Upper-case variant of field.name.kebab-case; word boundaries are identical.
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.upperCase(tool.toKebabCase(it.fieldName()))
```
